## Purpose
This PR is to improve the perf of DSv4 on ROCm. 
Changes include:
1. Use AITER topk decode to replace vLLM's own compiled extension (torch.ops._C.top_k_per_row_decode);
2. Use AITER batched_gemm_bf16 to replace torch.einsum in rocm_inv_rope_einsum for small decode batches(T <= 32);
3. Replaces tl.exp with tl.exp2 which ROCm platform has native instruction support;

For MRV1, the perf for different settings (concurrency=[1, 4, 16, 64], ISL=8K, OSL=1K) has ~5% improvement on TPOT.

